      </div>

      <hr style="border-color: #333; margin: 15px 0;">

      <div class="route-section">
        <h4>🚘 From Kottayam (~29.1 km)</h4>
        <p>Take <strong>Kottayam - Kumarakom Rd</strong> and <strong>SH42</strong> towards Thottakom, Vaikom.</p>
        <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/%E0%B4%95%E0%B5%8B%E0%B4%9F%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%9F%E0%B4%AF%E0%B4%82,+%E0%B4%95%E0%B5%87%E0%B4%B0%E0%B4%B3,+%E0%B4%87%E0%B4%A8%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%A4%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%AF/%E0%B4%A1%E0%B4%BF+%E0%B4%AA%E0%B5%8B%E0%B5%BE+%E0%B4%A1%E0%B4%BF%E0%B4%B5%E0%B5%88%E0%B5%BB+%E0%B4%B1%E0%B4%BF%E0%B4%9F%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%B0%E0%B5%80%E0%B4%B1%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%B1%E0%B5%8D+%E0%B4%B8%E0%B5%86%E0%B5%BB%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%B1%E0%B5%BC,+De+Paul+Retreat,+%E0%B4%B5%E0%B5%88%E0%B4%95%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%95%E0%B4%82,+%E0%B4%A4%E0%B4%B2%E0%B4%AF%E0%B4%BE%E0%B4%B4%E0%B4%82,+%E0%B4%95%E0%B5%87%E0%B4%B0%E0%B4%B3,+%E0%B4%87%E0%B4%A8%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%A4%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%AF/data=!4m14!4m13!1m5!1m1!19sChIJX0NrbKErBjsRbtCNj_YCK74!2m2!1d76.5221531!2d9.5915667999999989!1m5!1m1!19sChIJNUpcIMF5CDsRJxPR6s5J_Aw!2m2!1d76.4047666!2d9.7380268!3e0?entry=gemini&utm_source=gemini&utm_campaign=gem-default" target="_blank" style="color: var(--gold-accent);">View Kottayam Route on Map</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <p>Prayerful Regards & Blessings</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
